<title>BELGIUM: KB Securities raises Dexia CC to hold.</title>
<headline>KB Securities raises Dexia CC to hold.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>Dexia CC	    banking     3,645 *   KB Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Acquisition of 40 percent of Italian bank Crediop will contribute to diversification of Dexia's activities and should contribute positively to profit from 1997. However, overall profit growth in 1997 will be more difficult to maintain than in 1996. After 1997 earnings growth can re-surge. As part of overall upgrading of banking sector to neutral plus, Dexia CC is raised to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;hold minus&quot;.</p>
<p>Recommendation: HOLD. Analyst: Dirk Peeters</p>
<p>(*) Date of research report: 01/03/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Net dividend</p>
<p> 1995	   223 BFR    n/a	 n/a     14.3 BFR</p>
<p> 1996	   263 BFR    n/a	 11.0    80.1 BFR</p>
<p> 1997	   266 BFR    n/a	 13.7    88.3 BFR</p>
<p> 1998	   291 BFR    n/a	 12.5    99.4 BFR</p>
